  "statement": "\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNow, manually type in the digits the calculator gives for \u003cimg width\u003d\"25\" height\u003d\"23\" src\u003d\"/modules/gcprealgpractice/gcprealgpractice_8_1_realnumbersandthepythagoreantheorem_1b_70/image001.gif\" class\u003d\"text-bottom\"\u003e, and square this number. What happens? What does this tell you about how your calculator works?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
